dataset|variable|label|type|source|derivation
ADSL|STUDYID|Study Identifier|text|DM.STUDYID|Copied from DM
ADSL|USUBJID|Unique Subject Identifier|text|DM.USUBJID|Copied from DM
ADSL|SUBJID|Subject Identifier for the Study|text|DM.SUBJID|Copied from DM
ADSL|SITEID|Study Site Identifier|text|DM.SITEID|Copied from DM
ADSL|COHORT|Dose Escalation Cohort|integer|DM.ARMCD|Numeric part of ARMCD (C1 -> 1)
ADSL|TRT01P|Planned Treatment for Period 01|text|DM.ARM|Copied from DM.ARM
ADSL|TRT01PN|Planned Dose (mg)|integer|DM.ARM|Dose parsed from ARM text (e.g. DRUGX 100 mg Q3W -> 100)
ADSL|TRT01A|Actual Treatment for Period 01|text|EX.EXDOSE|DRUGX <first administered EXDOSE> mg Q3W; missing if never dosed
ADSL|TRT01AN|Actual Dose (mg)|integer|EX.EXDOSE|EXDOSE of first administration (ordered by EXSTDTC)
ADSL|AGE|Age (years)|integer|DM.AGE|Copied from DM
ADSL|AGEGR1|Pooled Age Group 1|text|DM.AGE|>=65 if AGE>=65 else <65 (SAP 3.1)
ADSL|SEX|Sex|text|DM.SEX|Copied from DM
ADSL|RACE|Race|text|DM.RACE|Copied from DM
ADSL|ECOG|ECOG Performance Status at Baseline|integer|DM.ECOG|Copied from DM
ADSL|TUMTYPE|Primary Tumour Type|text|DM.TUMTYPE|Copied from DM
ADSL|TRTSDT|Date of First Exposure to Treatment|date|EX.EXSTDTC|Date part of earliest EXSTDTC (SAP 4.1)
ADSL|TRTSDTM|Datetime of First Exposure to Treatment|datetime|EX.EXSTDTC|Earliest EXSTDTC as datetime (UTC)
ADSL|TRTEDT|Date of Last Exposure to Treatment|date|EX.EXSTDTC|Date part of latest EXSTDTC
ADSL|NDOSES|Number of Doses Received|integer|EX|Count of EX records per subject
ADSL|CUMDOSE|Cumulative Dose (mg)|float|EX.EXDOSE|Sum of EXDOSE
ADSL|TRTDURD|Treatment Duration (Days)|integer|Derived|TRTEDT - TRTSDT + 1
ADSL|EOSDT|End of Treatment Date|date|DS.DSSTDTC|Date part of DSSTDTC (data cut-off date for ongoing subjects)
ADSL|EOSSTT|End of Treatment Status|text|DS.DSDECOD|ONGOING / COMPLETED / DISCONTINUED mapped from DSDECOD
ADSL|DCSREAS|Reason for Discontinuation|text|DS.DSDECOD|Copied from DSDECOD
ADSL|SAFFL|Safety Population Flag|text|Derived|Y if at least one dose received (SAP 3.1)
ADSL|PKFL|PK Population Flag|text|PC|Y if >=1 quantifiable post-dose concentration (SAP 3.2)
ADSL|DLTFL|Dose-Limiting Toxicity Flag|text|ADAE.DLTFL|Y if any ADAE record has DLTFL = Y
ADSL|DLTEVLFL|DLT-Evaluable Population Flag|text|Derived|Y if SAFFL = Y and (DLTFL = Y or >=21 days from first dose to EOSDT) (SAP 3.3)
ADAE|STUDYID|Study Identifier|text|AE.STUDYID|Copied from AE
ADAE|USUBJID|Unique Subject Identifier|text|AE.USUBJID|Copied from AE
ADAE|AESEQ|Sequence Number|integer|AE.AESEQ|Copied from AE
ADAE|COHORT|Dose Escalation Cohort|integer|ADSL.COHORT|Merged from ADSL
ADAE|TRT01PN|Planned Dose (mg)|integer|ADSL.TRT01PN|Merged from ADSL
ADAE|AETERM|Reported Term for the Adverse Event|text|AE.AETERM|Copied from AE (verbatim)
ADAE|AEDECOD|Dictionary-Derived Term|text|AE.AEDECOD|Copied from AE (MedDRA PT)
ADAE|AESTDTC|Start Date/Time of Adverse Event (raw)|text|AE.AESTDTC|Copied from AE (may be partial)
ADAE|ASTDT|Analysis Start Date|date|AE.AESTDTC|Partial date YYYY-MM imputed to first of month; if same month as TRTSDT use TRTSDT (SAP 6.2)
ADAE|ASTDTF|Analysis Start Date Imputation Flag|text|Derived|D if day imputed; M if month imputed; blank if complete
ADAE|AENDT|Analysis End Date|date|AE.AEENDTC|Date part of AEENDTC; missing if ongoing
ADAE|ASTDY|Analysis Start Relative Day|integer|Derived|Study day of ASTDT vs TRTSDT (no day 0)
ADAE|AENDY|Analysis End Relative Day|integer|Derived|Study day of AENDT vs TRTSDT (no day 0)
ADAE|ATOXGR|Analysis Toxicity Grade|text|AE.AETOXGR|GRADE <AETOXGR>
ADAE|ATOXGRN|Analysis Toxicity Grade (N)|integer|AE.AETOXGR|AETOXGR as integer
ADAE|AESERFL|Serious Event Flag|text|AE.AESER|Copied from AESER
ADAE|RELFL|Related to Study Drug Flag|text|AE.AEREL|Y if AEREL = RELATED
ADAE|AEOUT|Outcome of Adverse Event|text|AE.AEOUT|Copied from AE
ADAE|TRTEMFL|Treatment-Emergent Flag|text|Derived|Y if TRTSDT <= ASTDT <= TRTEDT + 30 days (SAP 6.1)
ADAE|AESIFL|Adverse Event of Special Interest Flag|text|AE.AEDECOD|Y if PT is cytokine release syndrome or infusion related reaction
ADAE|DLTFL|Dose-Limiting Toxicity Flag|text|Derived|Y if TEAE, grade>=3, related, and ASTDY <= 21 (SAP 6.3)
ADAE|AOCCFL|1st Occurrence of Any TEAE Flag|text|Derived|Y for first TEAE per subject ordered by ASTDT and AESEQ
ADAE|AOCCPFL|1st Occurrence of PT TEAE Flag|text|Derived|Y for first TEAE per subject and AEDECOD
ADLB|STUDYID|Study Identifier|text|LB.STUDYID|Copied from LB
ADLB|USUBJID|Unique Subject Identifier|text|LB.USUBJID|Copied from LB
ADLB|COHORT|Dose Escalation Cohort|integer|ADSL.COHORT|Merged from ADSL
ADLB|TRT01PN|Planned Dose (mg)|integer|ADSL.TRT01PN|Merged from ADSL
ADLB|LBSEQ|Sequence Number|integer|LB.LBSEQ|Copied from LB
ADLB|PARAMCD|Parameter Code|text|LB.LBTESTCD|Copied from LBTESTCD
ADLB|PARAM|Parameter|text|LB.LBTEST|LBTEST followed by standard unit in brackets
ADLB|AVISIT|Analysis Visit|text|LB.VISIT|Copied from VISIT
ADLB|AVISITN|Analysis Visit (N)|integer|LB.VISITNUM|Copied from VISITNUM
ADLB|ADT|Analysis Date|date|LB.LBDTC|Date part of LBDTC
ADLB|ADY|Analysis Relative Day|integer|Derived|Study day of ADT vs TRTSDT (no day 0)
ADLB|AVAL|Analysis Value (standard units)|float|LB.LBORRES|LBORRES; haemoglobin g/dL multiplied by 10 to g/L (SAP 7.1)
ADLB|AVALU|Analysis Value Unit|text|Derived|Standard unit (HGB in g/L)
ADLB|ANRLO|Analysis Normal Range Lower Limit|float|LB.LBSTNRLO|LBSTNRLO with same unit conversion as AVAL
ADLB|ANRHI|Analysis Normal Range Upper Limit|float|LB.LBSTNRHI|LBSTNRHI with same unit conversion as AVAL
ADLB|ANRIND|Analysis Reference Range Indicator|text|Derived|LOW if AVAL<ANRLO; HIGH if AVAL>ANRHI; else NORMAL
ADLB|BASE|Baseline Value|float|Derived|AVAL of baseline record (last non-missing on or before TRTSDT)
ADLB|BNRIND|Baseline Reference Range Indicator|text|Derived|ANRIND of baseline record
ADLB|CHG|Change from Baseline|float|Derived|AVAL - BASE for post-baseline records
ADLB|PCHG|Percent Change from Baseline|float|Derived|100 * CHG / BASE
ADLB|SHIFT1|Shift from Baseline Reference Range|text|Derived|BNRIND to ANRIND for post-baseline records
ADLB|ABLFL|Baseline Record Flag|text|Derived|Y for last non-missing value on or before TRTSDT (SAP 7.2)
ADLB|LBORRES|Result in Original Units|float|LB.LBORRES|Copied from LB (traceability)
ADLB|LBORRESU|Original Units|text|LB.LBORRESU|Copied from LB (traceability)
