ADPC|USUBJID|Unique Subject Identifier|text|PC.USUBJID|Copied from PC
ADPC|COHORT|Dose Escalation Cohort|integer|ADSL.COHORT|Merged from ADSL
ADPC|TRT01PN|Planned Dose (mg)|integer|ADSL.TRT01PN|Merged from ADSL
ADPC|PCSEQ|Sequence Number|integer|PC.PCSEQ|Copied from PC
ADPC|PARAMCD|Parameter Code|text|Derived|DRUGX
