ADPC|AVISIT|Analysis Visit|text|Derived|CYCLE 1 for all PK profile records
ADPC|ATPT|Analysis Timepoint|text|PC.PCTPT|Label derived from nominal time
ADPC|ATPTN|Analysis Timepoint (N)|float|PC.PCTPT|Nominal hours post start of infusion
ADPC|ADTM|Analysis Datetime|datetime|PC.PCDTC|PCDTC as datetime (UTC)
ADPC|ARELTM|Actual Time from First Dose (h)|float|Derived|(ADTM - ADSL.TRTSDTM) in hours, rounded to 2 dp
ADPC|AVAL|Analysis Value (ng/mL)|float|PC.PCORRES|Numeric PCORRES; BLQ set to 0; not-done missing (SAP 5.1)
ADPC|AVALU|Analysis Value Unit|text|PC.PCORRESU|Copied from PCORRESU
ADPC|LLOQ|Lower Limit of Quantification|float|PC.PCLLOQ|Copied from PC
ADPC|BLQFL|Below Limit of Quantification Flag|text|PC.PCORRES|Y if PCORRES starts with <; missing if not done
ADPC|PCORRES|Result in Original Units|text|PC.PCORRES|Copied from PC (traceability)
ADPC|ANL01FL|Analysis Flag 01|text|Derived|Y if AVAL is not missing
ADPP|STUDYID|Study Identifier|text|Config|study_id from study configuration
ADPP|USUBJID|Unique Subject Identifier|text|ADPC.USUBJID|Subjects with PKFL = Y
ADPP|COHORT|Dose Escalation Cohort|integer|ADSL.COHORT|Merged from ADSL
ADPP|TRT01PN|Planned Dose (mg)|integer|ADSL.TRT01PN|Merged from ADSL
ADPP|PARAMN|Parameter (N)|integer|Derived|Parameter order
ADPP|PARAMCD|Parameter Code|text|Derived|NCA parameter code
ADPP|PARAM|Parameter|text|Derived|NCA parameter name
