ADPP|AVALU|Analysis Value Unit|text|Derived|Unit of the parameter
ADPP|AVISIT|Analysis Visit|text|Derived|CYCLE 1
ADBM|STUDYID|Study Identifier|text|Config|study_id from study configuration
ADBM|USUBJID|Unique Subject Identifier|text|BM.usubjid|Copied from BM (JSON)
ADBM|COHORT|Dose Escalation Cohort|integer|ADSL.COHORT|Merged from ADSL
ADBM|TRT01PN|Planned Dose (mg)|integer|ADSL.TRT01PN|Merged from ADSL
ADBM|SAMPID|Sample Identifier|text|BM.sample.id|Flattened from nested JSON
ADBM|PARAMCD|Parameter Code|text|BM.assay.analyte|CXCL10 or CTDNAVAF
ADBM|PARAM|Parameter|text|BM.assay.analyte|Parameter description with unit
ADBM|AVISIT|Analysis Visit|text|BM.sample.nominal_visit|Copied from nominal_visit
ADBM|ADTM|Analysis Datetime|datetime|BM.sample.collected|Collection datetime (UTC)
ADBM|ARELTM|Actual Time from First Dose (h)|float|Derived|(ADTM - ADSL.TRTSDTM) in hours, rounded to 2 dp
ADBM|AVAL|Analysis Value|float|BM.result|CXCL10: result.value; ctDNA: max of result.variants[].vaf; BLQ -> LLOQ/2 (SAP 8.2)
ADBM|AVALU|Analysis Value Unit|text|BM.assay.unit|Copied from assay.unit
ADBM|LLOQ|Lower Limit of Quantification|float|BM.assay.lloq|Copied from assay.lloq
ADBM|BLQFL|Below Limit of Quantification Flag|text|BM.result.flag|Y if result.flag = BLQ
ADBM|DTYPE|Derivation Type|text|Derived|LLOQ/2 when value imputed from BLQ
ADBM|BASE|Baseline Value|float|Derived|AVAL of last non-missing record on or before TRTSDTM; missing if no baseline sample (e.g. pre-amendment ctDNA)
ADBM|CHG|Change from Baseline|float|Derived|AVAL - BASE; missing if baseline missing or BLQ (SAP 8.3)
ADBM|PCHG|Percent Change from Baseline|float|Derived|100 * CHG / BASE
ADBM|R2BASE|Ratio to Baseline|float|Derived|AVAL / BASE (fold change)
ADBM|ABLFL|Baseline Record Flag|text|Derived|Y for baseline record
ADBM|BASEAVL|Baseline Available Flag|text|Derived|Y if BASE is not missing for subject and parameter
ADBM|RUNID|Assay Run Identifier|text|BM.assay.run_id|Flattened from nested JSON
ADBM|ANAME|Assay Name|text|BM.assay.name|Flattened from nested JSON
ADBM|MATRIX|Sample Matrix|text|BM.sample.matrix|Flattened from nested JSON
ADBM|NVAR|Number of Variants Called|integer|BM.result.variants|Length of nested variants array
