ADTR|USUBJID|Unique Subject Identifier|text|TR.USUBJID|Copied from TR
ADTR|COHORT|Dose Escalation Cohort|integer|ADSL.COHORT|Merged from ADSL
ADTR|TRT01PN|Planned Dose (mg)|integer|ADSL.TRT01PN|Merged from ADSL
ADTR|TRSEQ|Sequence Number|integer|TR.TRSEQ|Copied from TR
ADTR|PARAMCD|Parameter Code|text|Derived|SUMDIAM
ADTR|PARAM|Parameter|text|Derived|Sum of diameters of target lesions (mm)
ADTR|AVISIT|Analysis Visit|text|TR.VISIT|Copied from VISIT
ADTR|AVISITN|Analysis Visit (N)|integer|TR.VISIT|0 for BASELINE; number from WKnn otherwise
ADTR|ADT|Analysis Date|date|TR.TRDTC|Date of TRDTC
ADTR|ADY|Analysis Relative Day|integer|Derived|Study day of ADT vs TRTSDT (no day 0)
ADTR|AVAL|Analysis Value (mm)|float|TR.TRORRES|Copied from TRORRES
ADTR|AVALU|Analysis Value Unit|text|TR.TRORRESU|Copied from TRORRESU
ADTR|BASE|Baseline Value (mm)|float|Derived|Last non-missing AVAL on or before TRTSDT
ADTR|CHG|Change from Baseline (mm)|float|Derived|AVAL - BASE for post-baseline records
ADTR|PCHG|Percent Change from Baseline|float|Derived|100 * CHG / BASE
ADTR|NADIR|Smallest Prior Value incl. Baseline (mm)|float|Derived|Minimum AVAL over all earlier records (SAP 9.1)
ADTR|PCHGNAD|Percent Change from Nadir|float|Derived|100 * (AVAL - NADIR) / NADIR
ADTR|ABSINC|Absolute Increase from Nadir (mm)|float|Derived|AVAL - NADIR
ADTR|NEWLESFL|New Lesion Flag|text|TR.NEWLES|Copied from NEWLES
ADTR|AVALC|Visit Response|text|Derived|PD if new lesion or PCHGNAD>=20 and ABSINC>=5 mm; else PR if PCHG<=-30; else SD (SAP 9.1)
ADTR|ABLFL|Baseline Record Flag|text|Derived|Y for baseline record
ADRS|STUDYID|Study Identifier|text|ADSL.STUDYID|Merged from ADSL
ADRS|USUBJID|Unique Subject Identifier|text|ADSL.USUBJID|One record per subject
ADRS|COHORT|Dose Escalation Cohort|integer|ADSL.COHORT|Merged from ADSL
ADRS|TRT01PN|Planned Dose (mg)|integer|ADSL.TRT01PN|Merged from ADSL
ADRS|PARAMCD|Parameter Code|text|Derived|BOR
ADRS|PARAM|Parameter|text|Derived|Best overall response (unconfirmed)
ADRS|AVALC|Best Overall Response|text|ADTR.AVALC|Best of PR > SD > PD across post-baseline visits; NE if none (SAP 9.2)
ADRS|NASSESS|Number of Post-Baseline Assessments|integer|ADTR|Count of post-baseline ADTR records
ADRS|BESTPCHG|Best Percent Change from Baseline|float|ADTR.PCHG|Minimum PCHG across post-baseline visits
ADRS|BORDT|Date of Best Response|date|ADTR.ADT|Date of first visit achieving best response
ADRS|BORADY|Study Day of Best Response|integer|Derived|Study day of BORDT vs TRTSDT
ADRS|ORRFL|Objective Response Flag|text|Derived|Y if AVALC = PR
ADRS|DCRFL|Disease Control Flag|text|Derived|Y if AVALC is PR or SD
